{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11224120","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11224120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1122412001:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様に感謝……荷物を取り返してくれたんだね！","source_cn":"艾雅在上……你们真的找回了我的货物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABB2715C9E266ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1122412002:1":{"text":"泣くのはその辺にして、さっさと中身を改めてくれ。こっちは賞金をもらいに来たんだからな。","source_cn":"别光顾着痛哭流涕了，赶紧清点一下，我们还等着领赏金呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08999FA2A4B37282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122412003:1":{"text":"そう急かさないでおくれよ、ちゃんと確認するから……","source_cn":"哎呀，别急，让我仔细点点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7005A0E2C6E74109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122412004:1":{"text":"やだ……いろいろなくなってるわ！しかも高価な物ばかり！トータルで見れば損失はかなり抑えられたけど……","source_cn":"这……这比丢失之前，少了不少好东西啊！虽然整体损失不大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF1C47A936A50032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1122412005:1":{"text":"盗賊に奪われた荷物だぜ？むしろ何も減ってない方がおかしいだろ。","source_cn":"这批货在盗匪手里待了这么久，不缺斤少两才怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA2F64CD29C52D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122412006:1":{"text":"言っとくが、賞金をケチろうなんて思うなよ。さもないと、新しい指名手配を用意するハメになるぜ。","source_cn":"但我丑话说在前头，赏金可不能有半个金币的折扣。否则，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C52E00427D90F4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1122412007:1":{"text":"そ、そんなことは言ってないでしょ！ちゃんと懸賞内容に書かれてる額を支払うさ！","source_cn":"——别别别！我没这意思！悬赏令上说的赏金，绝对不会少了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4851933038F19113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1122412008:1":{"text":"そうかい、ならさっさと頼むぜ。","source_cn":"好吧，动作快点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD54FE8053CD0F50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1122412008":{"text":"そうかい、ならさっさと頼むぜ。","source_cn":"好吧，动作快点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD54FE8053CD0F50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1122412009:1":{"text":"これも基地の建設と……お前らの分け前を少しでも増やすためだ。","source_cn":"为了基地的建设——也为了让你们多挣点酬金。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2393AE917FDFE79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1122412010:1":{"text